  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Childhood Education (Timor-Leste)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Early Childhood Education (ECE) activity is being implemented in Timor-Leste over 2021-2026. The goal is that children grow into healthy and&#xa0;productive&#xa0;citizens who can contribute to the country&apos;s social and economic well-being. The Activity aims to achieve this by raising the quality of ECE, and expanding access to it.</narrative>
  </description>
